      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDSTAR HUNTER (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (26.28) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has ability and looks hard to stop. INSANE DANCER (5) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 352m behind Rockabye Baby (20.56) in a Grade 5. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. DENIM BEACH (1) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at Q Straight over 350m behind Major Story (19.44) in a Restricted WIN. The form from her last run stacks up well. Should be about the money. GEORGIE'S WONDER (6) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
